==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|ljúga||to lie|lang=non}}.

===Verb===
'''ljúga''' (''strong conjugation:'' [[laug]] – [[lugum]] – [[logið]])

# to [[lie]], to tell [[lies]]
#: ''Hún '''lýgur''' alltaf að mér.''
#:: She's always '''lying''' to me.
#: ''Ertu að '''ljúga'''?''
#:: Are you '''lying'''?

